{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_totter_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_totter_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"計劃外的情況，我會自行判斷。","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_totter_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"435469f4f7a332c4c1d37c453a01ef90370f63b741dd3962d1d8c551515a2796","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"開門，你個騙錢的雜種！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"給老子開門！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別裝睡，給老子爬起來開門！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你啊， 哈倫先生。你敲門的動靜太大了，會吵到周圍人的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（揪住鉛踝的領子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"混帳，我的錢很好拿是嗎？我本人很好糊弄是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你當時怎麼說的？周五就會給我結果！現在周五了，你他媽連離開的行李都打包好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈倫先生，你耐心點，之後我會向你解釋的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（扯開哈倫的手）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"解釋？我不要解釋，我要結果，明白嗎？我現在就要看到你帶著那群畜生的腦袋來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看錶）稍等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你說給你五天就夠，我給你了，結果呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認為現在計劃進展得非常順利，馬上就會有結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"計劃？你前面四天都在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"周一喝咖啡，周二打撲克，周三逛市集，周四睡大覺，現在就要到周五了，你還在屋裡連屁股都不打算挪一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看錶）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你他媽能不能別看你那破錶了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還不到時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你的意思是我太著急了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"媽的你個混帳當然不著急，因為被那群荒地劫匪奪走一切的人是我而不是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道，從你給的薪金可以看出來，你的積蓄所剩無幾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，但凡我還剩一點錢，你現在要操心的就不是別人的腦袋了，而是你自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然這麼說，我以為我們的雇傭關係還算良好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（頹然靠牆）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我就該跟著老婆一起在那場劫難中死去......也好過在你這裡受氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想喝熱水嗎？我可以為你倒一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你——算了，我為什麼要和你說這些......你對我的感受一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是......多多少少能有些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"那算我求你，做點什麼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看錶）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間到了，你要一起來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按你的要求，血債血償。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這裡了，你有把騎來的馱獸藏好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"藏好了......不對，我花錢雇傭了你，為什麼你卻在指揮我幹活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不好意思，哈倫先生，那要不我再去把它捆一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不必了，你不如先向我解釋你拉我來這破地方到底要幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"望遠鏡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，看那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼也沒有看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再往更遠處看，從地平線緩緩朝這裡駛來的一列車隊，血紅色的旗幟，黑色的骷髏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"是他們，我看到了，就是他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拉開弓弦）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要望遠鏡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，這麼遠，你能瞄準嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓——安靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，任務完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？你難道還想看別的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"還有別的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"褻瀆屍體不太好吧？如果你非常想的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你......已經確定了他們沒有人存活嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看爆炸波及的範圍，嗯，應該希望不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"都死了，死得好，死得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的語氣聽起來很唏噓，我以為仇人死了你會開心起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我也以為自己會開心，但是......發生得太快了，感覺很不真實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這個時候提不太好，但是那個另一半......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（丟出一袋金幣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去，你都拿去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（撿起錢袋）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有什麼要說的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝惠顧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"那群廢物派人找了整整一個月都摸不著他們的蹤跡，你是怎麼辦到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道他們會在這個時間，這個地點出現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，別在這裡說，換個地方吧，我得好好喝一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在的狀態不適合飲酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你又怎麼知道呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，這個鎮子的人會在清晨飲酒，就是為了慶祝太陽升起。我點了兩杯，你要哪一杯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩杯的大小看起來有些懸殊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，因為大杯是我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼要我選？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"因為客套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我選小杯，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（舉起杯子一口氣喝掉半杯）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——嗝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"現在可以給我講講嗎？你是怎麼做到的？你前幾天什麼都沒有準備，只是時間到了，出現在那裡，然後拉開弓，咻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"他們就全沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你會預知？還是你買通了他們中的一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"來來，快點告訴我吧，我實在想不通。昨天晚上找到你時我還覺得你這傢伙一定是在騙我，現在我對你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖——簡直五體投地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有些亢奮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我喝酒了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做到這些並不難，有一個完備的計劃，一步一步跟著來，結果總是大差不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掏出自己的筆記本）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾抱怨周一我在這裡的咖啡館待了一整天無所事事，但咖啡館在鎮子裡有很特殊的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於往來的商旅，它更像......資訊集散中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的消息都是從那裡散佈出去的，無論是可靠的消息，還是、咳、假消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡椒商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你手裡的香料運出去了嗎？我試過換另外的線路，但是幾乎每次都會遇到埋伏，那些傢伙對我們的行蹤可以說是瞭若指掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乳香商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還在想辦法。不然請雇傭兵來護送商隊？總比積壓在倉庫裡好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡椒商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......王酋軍遲遲不來清剿，不知這樣的日子何時能結束。我帳上的數字已經難以負擔更多的支出了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好，請問要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一杯咖啡，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的咖啡味道濃厚，或許您會覺得苦澀難咽，這碟蜜漬椰棗送給您，喝完可以吃一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，我不怕苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，可以問下這鎮子裡的醫生住在哪裡嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，東面，順著噴泉一路向東走就能看到的。您生病了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一批急救藥品，或許有人會想要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在荒地上，萬能的貨幣是藥品而不是金錢，消息我已經放出去了，接下來，我需要證明，我值得他們專門為我來一趟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然都到這個時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"首飾商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"朋友，你今天可輸得有點慘，看這大把的金幣，你太太看到一定不會輕易甘休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是些小錢而已，怡情所用，無傷大雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"木材商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，我們就是喜歡你這樣闊氣的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你們還要再來一局嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周三一早，果不其然，我居所的窗下出現了陌生的腳印，雖然有被掩蓋，但手法並不專業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈倫先生，你打過獵嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動物有自己的領地，在領地內覓食、嬉戲、巡視都有自己的規律。摸準它們的習慣，放置陷阱便成了一件輕鬆的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_srgmarket"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小販A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你這麼快就打算要離開了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，此地盛傳的關於荒地劫匪的事讓我無法安心，能儘快抽身離開最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我想向諸位諮詢，你們知道還有什麼其他的路可以從這裡離開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小販A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"實話和你說，先生，走哪條路都沒有用，你根本無法躲開他們的突襲，他們準確掌握著你的所有動向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都有被襲擊的經歷嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上次我的商隊從鎮子東邊的小路出發，想著那群畜生不會注意，但離開不到一小時，就遇到了他們的埋伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是太可怕了，你們中間就沒有人僥倖逃過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這一個月我們試過無數的道路，無論是偏僻的小徑，還是堂皇的大道，只要一踏上路面，就必定會遭遇這些不幸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"透過對比這些商隊的路線和他們遇到劫匪的地點，我大致確定了這些不法之徒的行動範圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並找到了幾個合適的狙擊點，確保我的弓弩射程能夠完全覆蓋這些地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後我要做的便是驅趕獵物進入陷阱了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小子，要不要賺一筆外快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，請問您有什麼吩咐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明天就要出遠門了，為我準備好十天的淡水和乾糧，馱獸要在夜晚來臨前餵足糧草，天沒亮我就得出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對了，這是你的報酬，四個金幣，明天五點我會在鎮子的西口等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，您真是太慷慨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從現在開始不要打擾我，我得在出行前補足睡眠，不要傻站著了，快去辦事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機靈的男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好好，沒問題，我做事包您滿意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，做這些事情只需要兩個金幣，但我多給了一倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個年紀的孩子，多賺一筆難免四處炫耀。他告訴的人越多，我的目標就越容易達成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你昨天並沒有在睡覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我確實睡了很長時間，第二天用眼睛，我得保持充足的精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（喝了一口酒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"居然......就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來你好像很失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我以為我能聽到的，是一個傳奇雇傭兵的驚世傳說，但是聽下來感覺更像我老婆拿給我的商業計劃書，很詳細，卻也很乏味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的計劃不應該有太多的起伏，越穩妥越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"她也這麼說！她甚至和你一樣，隨身帶著一個筆記本來記她的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得這個習慣很不錯，人相信什麼都不能相信自己的破記性。那她現在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"被劫匪一刀砍掉了腦袋......我記得剛找上你的時候就告訴你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，至少現在她不用再為做計劃書而煩惱了。要不是我當初強拉她摻和進自己的生意，她現在應該會做個詩人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，詩人是個不錯的職業，挺安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我說實話會冒犯你嗎？和你聊天讓我感覺不太舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，很多人都這麼說，我很感激那些只是嘴上說說的人，有更多的人他們會直接動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"理智告訴我，我應該說點什麼安慰你，但是很遺憾，我的情感不容許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）唉，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看看你的筆記本嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好的，請。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，這麼大的字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的眼睛有點小毛病，近處的事物反而沒有遠處的看得清晰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎，你很仔細地規劃了生活裡的每一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，有個框架，遇到麻煩了就不會手忙腳亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（闔上本子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你這樣的人，一定將一切都牢牢攥在手心裡，一點差錯也不會有，一絲偏移都不會有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"想必你的人生肯定是在你的掌控下一帆風順，不會突然有一天就陷入一無所有的境地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（灌了一大口酒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不安地摩挲著杯把）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"不是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我的人生裡從來就沒幾件事能在我的掌控之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕抿一口酒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"可憐的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請別這麼說我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我在說我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿起杯子一飲而盡）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"結帳吧，我得走了。嘶，我身上的錢呢......啊，我都忘了，已經全部支付給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我來結吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不這些金幣你拿走吧，以後身無分文怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那些你留著吧，我應該用不到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喝醉了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不用管我，我能自己站起來。拜拜了，朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"♪白晝消逝前，我伸臂攬她入懷♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"♪她淺紫色的面紗下，茉莉香氣暗暗氤氳♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"♪那片柔軟的雙唇將帶我離開♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"♪去往永恆的故園♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"♪那一刻的陣痛，終結我的一生♪"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒醉的商人迎著從地平線升起的朝陽，拖著蹣跚的步伐漸漸步入那片火紅色的巨輪，他的背影義無反顧，就像投入戀人炙熱的懷抱。\n沙漠裡乾燥的風將他的歌聲溫柔地裹上細沙，妥善保存，然後送至下一個旅人的喉間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪路易薩，我心裡的路易薩♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪帶我歸家，有你相伴，我別無所求♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪路易薩，我夢裡的路易薩♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然很難說出口，但是托特爾，我們只能將你安置在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的隊伍將繼續北上，因為腳傷，你無法跟上我們的速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要把我丟在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡靠近雪境，雪景很美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算把我丟在這裡，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會給你留下一筆錢，離這不遠有個村莊，你可以換些生活必需的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你他媽別再繞圈子了！回答我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"托特爾，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安，告訴我，你也是這麼想的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別這樣，你也清楚不是嗎？隊伍不可能為了你放慢腳步，我們都有任務需要完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們都要丟下我，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你已經不是孩子了，鬧脾氣最不是個辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我們當初約定好的，安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰都料不到未來的事......托特爾。來年春天，或許我們會返回，或許那時情況又會不一樣，別太喪氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那你們會來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪路易薩，我心裡的路易薩♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪帶我歸家，有你相伴，我別無所求♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪路易薩，我夢裡的路易薩♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪我將永遠等候你......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪......的到來♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿起杯子一飲而盡）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鑰匙，鑰匙在哪裡？"},{"type":"narration","text":"是這把嗎？\n不對，開不了，不是這把。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這把？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是......不開了，就這樣吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（席地坐下）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......幾點了，約定好的時間應該快到了，就在門外等著好了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"屋簷在高溫的沙地上投下一片陰影，隔絕了炎熱的空氣與酷辣的陽光，將鉛踝蜷起的身體納入陰影。\n在一陣和風中，鉛踝的眼皮再也支撐不住，緊緊地闔上了。\n背靠著門框，他在一片酣夢中安睡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"鉛踝先生，鉛踝先生，醒醒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......啊！怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來接你的幹員，對不起，來的路上飛行器遭遇了沙暴，所以延誤了，你沒有等很久吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（站起來拍拍褲子上的土）沒有沒有，你來得正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可我看你都睡著了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是小睡一陣，剛剛才出門，沒有睡很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你......為什麼在笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我笑了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸摸自己的嘴角）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，我為什麼笑了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
